    "sections": {
      "boss": {
        "description": "Every week a boss shows up, Minor, Standard or Elite, and its health bar belongs to the whole squad. Every hit anyone lands, from a match or a challenge, drains it. Bring it down before Sunday night, or it lives to fight another week.",
